OL,3,GNEWSAMissed SEN assessment target sees
OL,4,Aresignation call
OL,5,
OL,6,FFewer than one in 10 assessments for
OL,7,Fchildren with special educational needs
OL,8,F(SEN) in Warwickshire, are being
OL,9,Fcompleted within the government's
OL,10,Fmandatory 20-week time frame, according
OL,11,Fto data from Warwickshire County
OL,12,FCouncil.
OL,14,FA report presented to the council's
OL,15,Fcabinet stated that when the latest set
OL,16,Fof figures were compiled at the end of
OL,17,FJune, just 9.2% of education, health
OL,18,Fand care (EHC) plans were completed
OL,19,Fwithin the required period.
OL,21,FThe average wait in the county was said
OL,22,Fto be 28 weeks.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
